/E (Scalp traders execute numerous small trades within a low time frame, seeking to profit from minor price movements in seconds or minutes. This trading style requires a keen understanding of price action, market dynamics, and quick execution. Scalper traders need to be extremely diligent and disciplined individuals due to the need to be strict about how long they keep positions open. They cut trades at very specific profit targets and even stricter levels of loss. Scalpers would never wait to see whether a losing trade will turn into a winning one.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
