1531 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 817 0 R
/E (Being able to identify market structure by looking at trends is crucial as it helps traders visualize the direction in which the market is moving. Market structure and trends make it much easier to identify potential trend reversals or areas of support and resistance. The information given from identifying trends is key to helping you better understand the overall market direction, especially when making informed decisions regarding entry and exit points.)
/Pg 61 0 R
/K [2]
>>
