<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 823 0 R
/T (Support and resistance can be found in all charting time frames: daily, weekly, and monthly, and can be a key part of your trading strategy. Please watch this video on mastering a support and resistance strategy to deepen your understanding. )
/E (Support and resistance can be found in all charting time frames: daily, weekly, and monthly, and can be a key part of your trading strategy. Please watch this video on mastering a support and resistance strategy to deepen your understanding. )
/Pg 67 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
