/E (In trading, the fear of missing out, or FOMO, arises when traders fear they might miss significant opportunities or believe that other traders are more successful. Traders who grasp the concept of FOMO, understand its origins, and recognize how they respond to it are better equipped to address it effectively. Dealing with FOMO is a highly valuable skill for traders, as it can not only have a negative emotional impact but also cloud judgment and logic, especially when making rapid trading decisions.)
/Pg 97 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
