/E (Some of the primary advantages of funded accounts include the ability to trade with larger sums of capital, performance-based compensation, and the removal of trading emotions from the equations due to not trading your own capital. This increased buying power allows traders to potentially amplify their profits. Additionally, funded accounts often come with a profit split basis and reduced or even zero commissions. This enables traders to retain more of their earnings.)
/Pg 115 0 R
/K [3]
>>
