/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 899 0 R
/E (As mentioned earlier in this book, understanding the impact of economic indicators and events on financial markets is crucial for effective decision-making in trading. Start by using economic calendars such as Forex Factory to track upcoming releases of economic indicators, central bank decisions, and other events that may influence market movements. Also, familiarize yourself with the interpretation of key economic indicators, such as GDP growth, employment reports, and inflation figures. This knowledge aids in anticipating market reactions and news trading \(if you wish to opt for that\).)
/Pg 143 0 R
>>
